## Check Slurm on the Compute Nodes

Once provisioning is complete every compute node has installed the base OS and
OpenHPC, run the configuration postscript, and started `munge` and `slurmd`.
Check the nodes with `sinfo`; all should report *idle* (without an asterisk). If
a node is shown as *unknown*, `scontrol update partition=normal state=idle` will
clear it.
